### `getLocalA1Degree(List,Ideal)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/A1BrouwerDegrees/Code/LocalGlobalDegrees.m2:142:59-267:5`
