```

```macaulay2
v3 = verts#3;
```

```macaulay2
T = new HashTable from {v0 => a^2*b, v1 => b*c^2, v2 => b^2, v3 => a*c};
```

```macaulay2
relabeledC = relabelCellComplex(C,T);
```

