# bertiniCheck
Checks whether the numerical version of the algorithms using Bertini works

- **Package:** [CharacteristicClasses](../../CharacteristicClasses/package/CharacteristicClasses.md)
- **Class:** [FunctionClosure](../../Core/type/FunctionClosure.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/CharacteristicClasses.m2:678:15-701:5`
- **Aliases:** `CharacteristicClasses$bertiniCheck`

## Description
The functions [Chern](../../CharacteristicClasses/methodFunction/Chern.md), [Segre](../../CharacteristicClasses/methodFunction/Segre.md), [CSM](../../CharacteristicClasses/methodFunction/CSM.md) and [Euler](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/Euler.md) have the option [CompMethod](../../CharacteristicClasses/symbol/CompMethod.md), which can be any of [ProjectiveDegree](../../CharacteristicClasses/symbol/ProjectiveDegree.md), [PnResidual](../../CharacteristicClasses/symbol/PnResidual.md), or [bertini](../../CharacteristicClasses/symbol/bertini.md). The option "bertini" uses the external program Bertini, which might not be installed on the user's system. The function bertiniCheck checks whether Bertini is properly installed and configured.

## Source
```m2
bertiniCheck = () -> (

    setRandomSeed 24;
    x := symbol x; y := symbol y; z := symbol z; w := symbol w;

    -- smooth example for Segre and ChernClass
    R := QQ[x,y,z,w];
    I := minors(2,matrix{{x,y,z},{y,z,w}});
    totalSegre := Segre(I, CompMethod=>bertini);
    assert( totalSegre == 3*( (ring(totalSegre))_0 )^2 - 10*( (ring(totalSegre))_0 )^3 );
    totalChern := Chern(I, CompMethod=>bertini);
    assert( totalChern == 3*( (ring(totalChern))_0 )^2 + 2 * ((ring(totalChern))_0)^3 );

    -- singular example for CSM Class and Euler
    S := QQ[x,y,z];
    J := ideal(x^3 + x^2*z - y^2*z);
    totalCSM := CSM(J, CompMethod=>bertini);
    assert( totalCSM == 3*( (ring(totalCSM))_0 ) + 1*( (ring(totalCSM))_0 )^2 );
    eulerCharacteristic := Euler(J, CompMethod=>bertini);
    assert( eulerCharacteristic == 1 );

    print "Test passed for the option CompMethod=>bertini for the commands Chern, Segre, CSM and Euler.";

    )  
```

## See also
- [configuring Bertini](configuring_spc_Bertini.md)

