# symmetricDivisorM0nbar
Create a symmetric divisor on the moduli space of stable pointed genus 0 curves

- **Package:** [ConformalBlocks](../../ConformalBlocks/package/ConformalBlocks.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunction](../../Core/type/MethodFunction.md)
- **Protected:** true
