- **Result type:** [SymmetricDivisorM0nbar](../../ConformalBlocks/type/SymmetricDivisorM0nbar.md)
- **Aliases:** `ConformalBlocks$symmetricDivisorM0nbar`

## Description
A symmetric divisor on $\bar{M}_{0, n}$ may be created in either one of two ways.  The user may either enter the number of marked points $n$ and a linear polynomial in the [standard basis](standard_spc_basis.md) classes $B_i$, or  enter $n$ and a list of the coefficients of $D$ in the standard basis.  Both usages are demonstrated in the example below.

## Parameters
- **L** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md),
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md),

## Returns
