- [`symmetricDivisorM0nbar(ZZ,IndexedVariable)`](#symmetricdivisorm0nbarzzindexedvariable)
- [`symmetricDivisorM0nbar(ZZ,Expression)`](#symmetricdivisorm0nbarzzexpression)

## Examples
```macaulay2
D=symmetricDivisorM0nbar(6,{2,3})
```

