Other Functions generating [hypertext list format](hypertext_spc_list_spc_format.md) that you may use:[SYNOPSIS](../../Core/methodFunction/SYNOPSIS.md)[EXAMPLE](../../Core/methodFunction/EXAMPLE.md)

