#### Source
```m2
inverse MackeyFunctorHomomorphism := MackeyFunctorHomomorphism => f -> (
    if not isIsomorphism f then error("-- map must be invertible");
    fT := inverse f.FixedMap;
    fB := inverse f.UnderlyingMap;
    map(source f, target f, fB, fT)
    )
```

