# isCommutative
Whether a ring is commutative

- **Package:** [Core](../../Core/package/Core.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunction](../../Core/type/MethodFunction.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/m2/rings.m2:58:0-58:13`
