# liftToDGModuleMap
Lift an image of hom-degree-0 generators to a full DGModuleMap

- **Package:** [DGAlgebras](../../DGAlgebras/package/DGAlgebras.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/DGAlgebras.m2:4225:0-4225:17`
- **Result type:** [DGModuleMap](../../DGAlgebras/type/DGModuleMap.md)
- **Aliases:** `DGAlgebras$liftToDGModuleMap`

## Description
Starting from the supplied hom-degree-0 assignment, the routine inductively constructs images for each M-generator of hom-degree $d \geq 1$ by solving $d_N(x) = f(d_M(e))$ in N.natural at hom-degree $d$.  Existence of a lift at every step is what requires N to be acyclic.  The lift is not unique in general: different choices of preimage at each step produce chain-homotopic lifts.

## Parameters
- **h0** — A Matrix with one column per hom-degree-0 generator of M and (rank N.natural)-many rows whose entries lie in A.natural, or a List of Vectors (in N.natural), or a single Vector when M has exactly one hom-degree-0 generator.
- **M** — an instance of the type "DGModule", The source DGModule. Must be semifree (M.natural a free module).
- **N** — an instance of the type "DGModule", The target DGModule. Must be acyclic in positive hom-degrees up to EndDegree so that lifts exist.

## Returns
f, an instance of the type "DGModuleMap",

## Options
- **[EndDegree](../../DGAlgebras/symbol/EndDegree.md)** (default: `-1`)

## Methods
- [`liftToDGModuleMap(DGModule,DGModule,Matrix)`](#lifttodgmodulemapdgmoduledgmodulematrix)
- [`liftToDGModuleMap(DGModule,DGModule,Vector)`](#lifttodgmodulemapdgmoduledgmodulevector)
- [`liftToDGModuleMap(DGModule,DGModule,List)`](#lifttodgmodulemapdgmoduledgmodulelist)

