# detResDeg
Compute a regularity index and partial degrees of the determinantal resultant

- **Package:** [EliminationMatrices](../../EliminationMatrices/package/EliminationMatrices.md)
- **Class:** [FunctionClosure](../../Core/type/FunctionClosure.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/EliminationMatrices.m2:643:10-673:1`
- **Result type:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md)
- **Aliases:** `EliminationMatrices$detResDeg`

## Description
Compute the regularity index and the multi-degree of the determinantal resultant associated to the matrix M

## Parameters
- **c** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), a list of degrees indexing the columns of a polynomial matrix
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), corresponding to the drop of rank used to form the determinantal resultant
- **R** — a [Ring](../../Core/type/Ring.md), an ambient ring where the computations take place
- **r** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), a list of degrees indexing the rows of the same polynomial

## Returns
a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), a list of element consisting of a regularity index and partial degree of homogeneity of the determinantal resultant

## Examples
```macaulay2
R = ZZ[d1,d2,d3,k1,k2]
```

```
o1 = R
o1 : PolynomialRing
```

```macaulay2
detResDeg(1,{d1,d2,d3},{k1,k2},R)
```

```
o2 = {d1 + d2 + d3 - k1 - 2k2 - 1, {d2 + d3 - k1 - k2, d1 + d3 - k1 - k2, d1
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     + d2 - k1 - k2}}
o2 : List
```

## Source
```m2
detResDeg=(r,dp,dk,R) -> (

   m:=#dp;n:=#dk;
   h:=getSymbol "h";
   t:=getSymbol "t";
   nR:=R(monoid[h,t]); 
   sdp:=0_nR;sdk:=0_nR;
   for i from 1 to m do sdp=sdp+dp#(i-1)_nR;
   for i from 1 to n do sdk=sdk+dk#(i-1)_nR;
   subsdk:=0_nR;dk=sort(dk);
   for i from 1 to n-r do subsdk=subsdk+dk#(i-1)_nR;
   reg:=(n-r)*(sdp - sdk)-(m-n)*subsdk-(m-r)*(n-r)+1;
   vmax:=m+n-2*r-1;
   vmin:=m-n+1;
   F:={};i:=0;j:=0;
   for i from 1 to n do 
       F=F|{sum for j from 0 to vmax list ((nR_1)*(dk#(i-1)_nR))^j};
   F=product(F);
   degs:={};E:=0;S:=0;coefS:=0;nc:=0;mTP:=0;
   for j from 0 to m-1 do (
   	 E=(1-((dp#j)_nR+(nR_0))*(nR_1))*product(0..j-1,i->1-((dp#i)_nR)*(nR_1))*product(j+1..m-1,i->1-((dp#i)_nR)*(nR_1)); 
    	S=coefficients(matrix{{E*F}},Variables=>{nR_1});--coeff en t
		coefS=transpose(S#1);nc=rank source coefS;--decreasing --All monomials in t appears 1,t,t^2,....
		mTP=coefS_{(nc-1-m+r)..(nc-1-m+n-1)};
		for i from 1 to n-r-1 do (
	    	mTP=mTP||coefS_{(nc-1-m+r-i)..(nc-1-m+n-1-i)};
		);
		degs=degs|{substitute(((coefficients(det(mTP),Variables=>{nR_0},Monomials=>{matrix{{nR_0}}}))_1)_(0,0),R)};
   );
   return({substitute(reg,R),degs})
);
```

