- **[OutFile](../../EquivariantGB/symbol/OutFile.md)**
- **[Algorithm](../../Core/symbol/Algorithm.md)** — algorithm choice for egb (default: `Buchberger`)
- **[PrincipalSyzygies](../../EquivariantGB/symbol/PrincipalSyzygies.md)** (default: `false`)

