### `fourierMotzkin(Matrix,Matrix)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/FourierMotzkin.m2:156:47-232:22`
- **Domain:** [Matrix](../../Core/type/Matrix.md), [Matrix](../../Core/type/Matrix.md)
