## Method details
### `compareFPT(Number,RingElement)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/FrobeniusThresholds/MainFunctions.m2:636:44-775:1`
- **Domain:** [Number](../../Core/type/Number.md), [RingElement](../../Core/type/RingElement.md)
