L1=F1/{a a b - b b a, a a a a b}
```

```
o2 = L1
o2 : LieAlgebra
```

```macaulay2
dims(1,6,L1)
```

```
o3 = {2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0}
o3 : List
```

```macaulay2
describe L1
```

```
o4 = generators => {a, b}
     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}
     Signs => {0, 0}
     ideal => { - (a b a) - (b b a),  - (a a a b a)}
     ambient => F1
     diff => {}
     Field => QQ
     computedDegree => 6
```

