F2 = lieAlgebra({a,b,c},Weights=>{{1,0},{1,0},{2,1}},
            Signs=>{1,1,1},LastWeightHomological=>true)
```

```
o5 = F2
o5 : LieAlgebra
```

```macaulay2
D2 = differentialLieAlgebra{0_F2,0_F2,a a + b b}
```

```
o6 = D2
o6 : LieAlgebra
```

```macaulay2
L2=D2/{a b,a c}
```

```
o7 = L2
o7 : LieAlgebra
```

