### `discreteVanishingIdeal(Ring,Digraph)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/GraphicalModels.m2:1024:52-1066:1`
- **Domain:** [Ring](../../Core/type/Ring.md), [Digraph](../../Graphs/type/Digraph.md)
