# isomorphism
Retrieve an isomorphism of modules

- **Package:** [Isomorphism](../../Isomorphism/package/Isomorphism.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/Isomorphism.m2:292:0-292:11`
- **Result type:** [Matrix](../../Core/type/Matrix.md)
- **Aliases:** `Isomorphism$isomorphism`

## Description
This method retrieves the isomorphism between the given modules. Note that this isomorphism is already cached if a previous call to [isIsomorphic](../../Isomorphism/methodFunction/isIsomorphic.md) returned true, but otherwise that function is called.

## Parameters
- **M** — a [Module](../../Core/type/Module.md),
- **N** — a [Module](../../Core/type/Module.md),

## Returns
f, a [Matrix](../../Core/type/Matrix.md), an isomorphism $M \to N$;

## Methods
- [`isomorphism(Module,Module)`](#isomorphismmodulemodule)
- [`isomorphism(Matroid,Matroid)`](#isomorphismmatroidmatroid)
- [`isomorphism(Poset,Poset)`](#isomorphismposetposet)
- [`isomorphism(ToricVectorBundleKlyachko,ToricVectorBundleKlyachko)`](#isomorphismtoricvectorbundleklyachkotoricvectorbundleklyachko)
- [`isomorphism(CoherentSheaf,CoherentSheaf)`](#isomorphismcoherentsheafcoherentsheaf)

