        2 1      1 2     1    0 2     0    1 2       0 1    2       1 0  
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                      2
     14s*t*u v  + 13u v , s*t*u u  - u )
            0 1      2 2       0 1    2
              ZZ
o1 : Ideal of --[s, t, u ..u , v ..v ]
              61        0   2   0   2
