- **g** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md)
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md)

## Returns
a "K3 surface" defined over $K$ with rank 2 lattice defined by the intersection matrix $\begin{pmatrix} 2g-2 & d \\ d & n \end{pmatrix}$,

## Options
- **[CoefficientRing](../../Core/symbol/CoefficientRing.md)** (default: `ZZ/65521`)
- **[Verbose](../../Core/symbol/Verbose.md)** (default: `false`)
- **[Strategy](../../Core/symbol/Strategy.md)**
- **[Singular](../../SpecialFanoFourfolds/symbol/Singular.md)**

## Methods
