- [`K3(GushelMukaiFourfold)`](#k3gushelmukaifourfold)
- [`K3(CubicFourfold)`](#k3cubicfourfold)
- [`K3(ZZ,ZZ,ZZ)`](#k3zzzzzz)
- [`K3(EmbeddedK3surface)`](#k3embeddedk3surface)
