- **Aliases:** `LatticePolytopes$epsilonBounds`

## Description
`epsilonBounds` is a function. It computes bounds for the Seshadri constant at a general point by applying a set of projections. The integer n determines which projections are considered.

## Parameters
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md),
- **P** — a [Polyhedron](../../Polyhedra/type/Polyhedron.md), of dimension 2

## Returns
L, a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), Containing bounds a and b such that a<=epsilon(X_P,L_P;1_P)<=b

## Methods
