- **Aliases:** `LatticePolytopes$gaussFiber`

## Description
`gaussFiber` is a function. It computes an irreducible component of the general fiber of the Gauss map as described in the paper [Gauss Maps of Toric Varieties](http://arxiv.org/abs/1403.0793)

## Parameters
- **A** — a [Matrix](../../Core/type/Matrix.md), or a [List](../../Core/type/List.md) where the columns are lattice points

## Returns
