sl4 = simpleLieAlgebra("A",3);
```

```macaulay2
LAB=lieAlgebraBasis(sl4);
```

```macaulay2
W=irreducibleLieAlgebraModule({1,1,0},sl4);
```

```macaulay2
L = GTrepresentationMatrices(W);
```

```macaulay2
rhoW = lieAlgebraRepresentation(W,LAB,L);
```

