LAB=lieAlgebraBasis(sl4);
```

```macaulay2
V=irreducibleLieAlgebraModule({1,1,0},sl4);
```

```macaulay2
L = GTrepresentationMatrices(V);
```

```macaulay2
rhoV = lieAlgebraRepresentation(V,LAB,L);
```

```macaulay2
W=irreducibleLieAlgebraModule({0,1,1},sl4);
```

```macaulay2
L = GTrepresentationMatrices(W);
```

