### `multiReesIdeal(List)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/MixedMultiplicity.m2:81:32-167:1`
- **Domain:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md)
