```

```
o7 = {{{5, 0, 0}, {1, 3, 1}, {1, 4, 0}, {0, 2, 3}, {3, 0, 2}, {0, 1, 4}, {0,
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     5, 0}, {4, 1, 0}, {2, 0, 3}, {4, 0, 1}}, {{1, 3, 1}, {1, 4, 0}, {2, 3,
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     0}, {0, 5, 0}, {1, 2, 2}, {3, 1, 1}, {0, 0, 5}, {1, 1, 3}, {4, 0, 1},
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
