# componentsOfKernel
Finds all minimal generators up to a given total degree in the kernel of a ring map

- **Package:** [MultigradedImplicitization](../../MultigradedImplicitization/package/MultigradedImplicitization.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/MultigradedImplicitization.m2:226:0-226:18`
- **Result type:** [MutableHashTable](../../Core/type/MutableHashTable.md)
- **Aliases:** `MultigradedImplicitization$componentsOfKernel`

## Description
Computes all minimal generators of $\ker(F)$ which are of total degree at most `d`.

If a grading in which $\ker(F)$ is homogeneous is already known or a specific grading is desired then the option `Grading` can be used to specify this. In this case the columns of the matrix `Grading` are automatically used to grade the source of $F$.

#### Caveat
If the option UseInterpolation is set to true then [interpolateComponent](../../MultigradedImplicitization/methodFunction/interpolateComponent.md) is used to compute polynomials in each homogeneous component instead of [computeComponent](../../MultigradedImplicitization/methodFunction/computeComponent.md) which is the default. In this case, the resulting polynomials are no longer guaranteed to be in $\ker(F)$ but instead belong to the ideal with high probability. Setting this option to true will often significantly speed up computation, especially when computing high degree polynomials in the kernel of dense polynomial maps.

## Parameters
- **d** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), the total degree at which to stop computing generators
- **F** — a [RingMap](../../Core/type/RingMap.md),

## Returns
a [MutableHashTable](../../Core/type/MutableHashTable.md), A mutable hashtable whose keys correspond to all homogeneous components of $\ker(F)$ and values correspond to generators in $\ker(F)$ with those components

## Options
- **[Grading](../../MultigradedImplicitization/symbol/Grading.md)**
- **[UseMatroid](../../MultigradedImplicitization/symbol/UseMatroid.md)** (default: `true`)
- **[UseInterpolation](../../MultigradedImplicitization/symbol/UseInterpolation.md)** (default: `false`)
- **[CoefficientRing](../../Core/symbol/CoefficientRing.md)** (default: `ZZ/32003`)
- **[Verbose](../../Core/symbol/Verbose.md)** — display detailed output during computation (default: `true`)

## Methods
- [`componentsOfKernel(Number,RingMap)`](#componentsofkernelnumberringmap)

## Examples
