# trackHomotopy
Follow points along a homotopy

- **Package:** [NumericalAlgebraicGeometry](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/package/NumericalAlgebraicGeometry.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/track.m2:706:0-706:13`
- **Result type:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md)
- **Aliases:** `NumericalAlgebraicGeometry$trackHomotopy`

## Description
This method implements homotopy continuation: it follows a given list `S` of start solutions along a [Homotopy](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/type/Homotopy.md) `H`.

Option [Field](../../PolyominoIdeals/symbol/Field.md) (the default is [CC](../../Core/type/CC.md), but one can imagine using [RR](../../Core/type/RR.md)) specifies which [InexactFieldFamily](../../Core/type/InexactFieldFamily.md) to use when adaptive precision is requested via `Precision=>infinity`. The rest are a subset of [numerical homotopy tracking options](numerical_spc_homotopy_spc_tracking_spc_options.md).

#### Caveat
Note for developers: the old implementation [track](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/methodFunction/track.md) eventually will be replaced by a call to [trackHomotopy](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/methodFunction/trackHomotopy.md). Alternative ways for calling (`H` could be a Sequence (a preSLP), Matrix, etc.) are deprecated and are for debugging purposes only.

## Parameters
- **H** — an instance of the type "Homotopy",
- **S** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), start solutions

## Returns
a [List](../../Core/type/List.md),

## Options
- **[Field](../../PolyominoIdeals/symbol/Field.md)**
- **[Software](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/Software.md)**
- **[NoOutput](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/NoOutput.md)**
- **[tStep](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/tStep.md)**
- **[tStepMin](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/tStepMin.md)**
- **[stepIncreaseFactor](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/stepIncreaseFactor.md)**
- **[numberSuccessesBeforeIncrease](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/numberSuccessesBeforeIncrease.md)**
- **[Predictor](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/Predictor.md)**
- **[maxCorrSteps](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/maxCorrSteps.md)**
- **[Precision](../../Core/symbol/Precision.md)**
- **[CorrectorTolerance](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/CorrectorTolerance.md)**
- **[EndZoneFactor](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/EndZoneFactor.md)**
- **[InfinityThreshold](../../NumericalAlgebraicGeometry/symbol/InfinityThreshold.md)**

## Methods
- [`trackHomotopy(Matrix,List)`](#trackhomotopymatrixlist)
- [`trackHomotopy(Sequence,List)`](#trackhomotopysequencelist)
