## Description
When the system is real (or rational) polynomial system, this function executes the gamma test based on the value computed by [computeConstants](../../NumericalCertification/methodFunction/computeConstants.md), and determine whether a given point is a real approximate solution  or not.

However, an input point is poorly approximated, it gives false even if the point is real. In this case, user should apply [newton](../../Units/object/newton.md) to the point to get more precise approximation.

