SchPblm = {
         ({2,1}, random(CC^6,CC^6)),
         ({2,1}, random(CC^6,CC^6)),
         ({2,1}, random(CC^6,CC^6))
         };
```

```macaulay2
solveSchubertProblem(SchPblm, k,n)
```

