# oiRes
Compute an OI-resolution

- **Package:** [OIGroebnerBases](../../OIGroebnerBases/package/OIGroebnerBases.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/OIGroebnerBases.m2:1034:0-1034:5`
- **Result type:** [OIResolution](../../OIGroebnerBases/type/OIResolution.md)
- **Aliases:** `OIGroebnerBases$oiRes`

## Description
Computes an OI-resolution of the submodule generated by `L` out to homological degree `n`. If `L` consists of homogeneous elements, then the resulting resolution will be graded and minimal out to homological degree $n-1$. The [Verbose](../../Core/symbol/Verbose.md) option must be either `true` or `false`, depending on whether one wants debug information printed.

The [Strategy](../../Core/symbol/Strategy.md) option has the following permissible values:

`Strategy => ``[FastNonminimal](../../Core/symbol/FastNonminimal.md)` for no post-processing of the Gröbner basis computed at each step`Strategy => ``[Minimize](../../Core/symbol/Minimize.md)` to minimize the Gröbner basis after it is computed at each step; see [minimizeOIGB](../../OIGroebnerBases/methodFunction/minimizeOIGB.md)`Strategy => ``[Reduce](../../Core/symbol/Reduce.md)` to reduce the Gröbner basis after it is computed at each step; see [reduceOIGB](../../OIGroebnerBases/methodFunction/reduceOIGB.md)The [TopNonminimal](../../OIGroebnerBases/symbol/TopNonminimal.md) option must be either `true` or `false`, depending on whether one wants the Gröbner basis in homological degree $n-1$ to be minimized. Therefore, use `TopNonminimal => true` for no minimization of the basis in degree $n-1$.

## Parameters
- **L** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md),
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md),

## Returns
an instance of the type "OIResolution",

## Options
- **[Verbose](../../Core/symbol/Verbose.md)** (default: `false`)
- **[Strategy](../../Core/symbol/Strategy.md)** (default: `Minimize`)
- **[TopNonminimal](../../OIGroebnerBases/symbol/TopNonminimal.md)** (default: `false`)

## Methods
- [`oiRes(List,ZZ)`](#oireslistzz)

## Examples
```macaulay2
P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);
```

```macaulay2
F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {1,1}, P);
```

```macaulay2
installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 2);
```

```macaulay2
b = x_(1,2)*x_(1,1)*e_(2,{2},1)+x_(2,2)*x_(2,1)*e_(2,{1},2);
```

```macaulay2
time oiRes({b}, 2, TopNonminimal => true)
 -- used 0.520105s (cpu); 0.277505s (thread); 0s (gc)
```

