## Method details
### `mixedVolume(List)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/PHCpack.m2:900:33-999:1`
- **Domain:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md)
