# concatPath
Concatenation of paths

- **Package:** [PathSignatures](../../PathSignatures/package/PathSignatures.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunction](../../Core/type/MethodFunction.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/PathSignatures/types.m2:106:0-106:10`
- **Aliases:** `PathSignatures$concatPath`

## Description
