## Description
Takes as input a list of polynomials in the same ring. Constructs a [Path](../../VectorGraphics/type/Path.md) object with one piece equal to the list of normalForm of the polynomial components of the path given in input. Automatically sets the dimension attribute of the object to the length of the list given as input.

## Parameters
- **polyPathList** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), A list of elements of the same ring, the components of the polynomial path.;

