needsPackage "SchurFunctors";
```

```macaulay2
P = QQ[e_0..e_3, SkewCommutative => true];
```

```macaulay2
M = pieriColumn({3,2,1}, {1}, P);
             60      64
```

```
o3 : Matrix P   <-- P
```

```macaulay2
numRows M, numColumns M
```

```
o4 = (60, 64)
o4 : Sequence
```

```macaulay2
-- Multi-strip: remove a vertical strip of length 2.
     P = QQ[e_0..e_3, SkewCommutative => true];
```

