# allNonAttackingRookConfigurations
All non-attacking rook configurations in Q

- **Package:** [PolyominoIdeals](../../PolyominoIdeals/package/PolyominoIdeals.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/PolyominoIdeals.m2:475:0-475:33`
- **Aliases:** `PolyominoIdeals$allNonAttackingRookConfigurations`

## Description
For a collection of cells $\mathcal{P}$, this function returns the list of all configurations of non-attacking rooks on $\mathcal{P}$.

## Parameters
- **Q** — a collection of cells

## Returns
the list of all configurations of non-attacking rooks on $\mathcal{P}$,

## Methods
- [`allNonAttackingRookConfigurations(CollectionOfCells)`](#allnonattackingrookconfigurationscollectionofcells)

## Examples
```macaulay2
Q = cellCollection {{1,1},{1,2},{2,1},{3,1},{3,2}};
```

```macaulay2
netList allNonAttackingRookConfigurations Q
     +------------------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
```

```
o2 = |{{1, 1}}                |{{1, 2}}        |{{2, 1}}        |{{3, 1}}        |{{3, 2}}        |
     +------------------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
     |{{2, 1}, {3, 2}}        |{{1, 2}, {3, 2}}|{{1, 2}, {2, 1}}|{{1, 1}, {3, 2}}|{{1, 2}, {3, 1}}|
     +------------------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
     |{{1, 2}, {2, 1}, {3, 2}}|                |                |                |                |
     +------------------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
```

