# greeneKleitmanPartition
Computes the Greene-Kleitman partition of a poset

- **Package:** [Posets](../../Posets/package/Posets.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/Posets.m2:442:20-442:43`
- **Aliases:** `Posets$greeneKleitmanPartition`

## Description
The Greene-Kleitman partition $l$ of $P$ is the partition such that the sum of the first $k$ parts of $l$ is the maximum number of elements in a union of $k$ [chains](../../Posets/methodFunction/chains.md) in $P$.

The conjugate of $l$ has the same property, but with chains replaced by [antichains](../../Posets/methodFunction/antichains.md).  Because of this, it is often better to count via antichains instead of chains.  This can be done by passing "antichains" as the Strategy.

The Greene-Kleitman partition of the $n$ [chain](../../Units/object/chain.md) is the partition of $n$ with $1$ part.

When the Strategy is "auto", for small posets, the strategies "chains" and "antichains" are used as a brute force search is performed. For larger posets, a max-flow computation is performed according to [BF01].

### References

[BF01] Thomas Britz and Sergey Fomin, [Finite Posets and Ferrer Shapes](https://doi.org/10.1006/aima.2000.1966), Adv. Math., 158.1 (2001), pp. 86-127.

## Parameters
- **P** — an instance of the type "Poset",

## Returns
l, an instance of the type "Partition", the Greene-Kleitman partition of $P$

## Options
- **[Strategy](../../Core/symbol/Strategy.md)** (default: `auto`)

## Methods
- [`greeneKleitmanPartition(Poset)`](#greenekleitmanpartitionposet)

## Examples
```macaulay2
P = poset {{1,2},{2,3},{3,4},{2,5},{6,3}};
```

```macaulay2
greeneKleitmanPartition P
```

```
o2 = Partition{4, 2}
o2 : Partition
```

```macaulay2
D = dominanceLattice 6;
```

```macaulay2
time greeneKleitmanPartition(D, Strategy => "antichains")
 -- used 0.42523s (cpu); 0.200375s (thread); 0s (gc)
```

```
o4 = Partition{9, 2}
o4 : Partition
```

```macaulay2
time greeneKleitmanPartition(D, Strategy => "chains")
 -- used 6.211e-06s (cpu); 6.08e-06s (thread); 0s (gc)
```

```
o5 = Partition{9, 2}
o5 : Partition
```

```macaulay2
greeneKleitmanPartition chain 10
```

```
o6 = Partition{10}
o6 : Partition
```

