# partitionLattice
Computes the lattice of set-partitions of size $n$

- **Package:** [Posets](../../Posets/package/Posets.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunction](../../Core/type/MethodFunction.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/Posets.m2:907:0-907:16`
- **Aliases:** `Posets$partitionLattice`

## Description
The partition lattice of order $n$ is the lattice of [setPartition](../../Posets/methodFunction/setPartition.md)s of the set $\{1,\ldots, n\}$ with ordering given by refinement.  That is, the set-partition $p$ is greater than or equal to the set-partition $q$ if each part of $p$ is contained in exactly one part of $q$.

## Parameters
- **n** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), the size of the set to partition

## Returns
P, an instance of the type "Poset",

## Methods
- [`partitionLattice(ZZ)`](#partitionlatticezz)

## Examples
```macaulay2
partitionLattice 3
```

```
o1 = Relation Matrix: | 1 1 1 1 1 |
                      | 0 1 0 0 1 |
                      | 0 0 1 0 1 |
                      | 0 0 0 1 1 |
                      | 0 0 0 0 1 |
o1 : Poset
```

## Source
```m2
partitionLattice = method()
```

## Method details
### `partitionLattice(ZZ)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/Posets.m2:908:32-927:5`
- **Domain:** [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md)
- **Returns:** [Poset](../../Posets/type/Poset.md) (this method)

#### Source
```m2
partitionLattice ZZ := Poset => n -> (
    L := toList (1..n);
    G := setPartition L;
    R := flatten apply(G, i-> partitionRefinementPairs i);
    M := matrix for w in G list for v in G list if all(v, v' -> any(w, w' -> isSubset(v', w'))) then 1 else 0;
    P := poset(G, R, M, AntisymmetryStrategy => "none");
    if posets'Precompute then (
        P.cache.connectedComponents = {toList(0 ..< #G)};
        idx := hashTable apply(#G, i -> P_i => i);
        P.cache.coveringRelations = apply(R, r -> {idx#(first r), idx#(last r)});
        pp := partition(v -> #v, G);
        P.cache.filtration = apply(sort keys pp, k -> apply(pp#k, v -> idx#v));
        P.cache.isLowerSemilattice = true;
        P.cache.isUpperSemilattice = true;
        P.cache.maximalElements = last P.cache.filtration;
        P.cache.minimalElements = first P.cache.filtration;
        P.cache.rankFunction = apply(G, f -> #f - 1);
        );
    P
    )
```

