# rationalPoints
Compute all of the rational points of an affine variety

- **Package:** [RationalPoints](../../RationalPoints/package/RationalPoints.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
