## Description
This function tries to serialize `t` into the file `f`, that is, convert it into a standard format for storage. In this case, we convert `t` into a string using [toExternalString](../../Core/methodFunction/toExternalString.md). This function is not intended for public use.

## Parameters
- **f** — a [String](../../Core/type/String.md), the filename
- **t** — a [Thing](../../Core/type/Thing.md), the variable to store

## Source
```m2
runExternalM2ReturnAnswer = (f,t) -> (
	assert(instance(f,String));
	try (
		file:=openOut(f);
		s:=toExternalString(t);
		file<<s<<flush<<close;
	) else (
		error "runExternalM2ReturnAnswer: failed to store output! Return type unhandled by toExternalString? Disk full or read-only?";
	);
);
```

