- **Aliases:** `SCSCP$newConnection`

## Description
The port to connect to may be specified either by giving only one argument of the form host: port or by specifying the second argument. If neither of these is present, the port defaults to 26133.

## Parameters
- **host** — a [String](../../Core/type/String.md), The name or IP address of the host to connect to, with an optional colon followed by the number of the port
- **port** — a [String](../../Core/type/String.md) or an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), providing the port number (this argument may be omitted)

## Returns
an instance of the type "SCSCPConnection", The connection that was established

