# flagBundle
Make a flag bundle

- **Package:** [Schubert2](../../Schubert2/package/Schubert2.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/Schubert2.m2:574:0-574:10`
- **Result type:** [FlagBundle](../../Schubert2/type/FlagBundle.md)
- **Aliases:** `Schubert2$flagBundle`

## Description
#### Consequences
The list `r` of ranks can be obtained later with `F. BundleRanks`, see [BundleRanks](../../Schubert2/symbol/BundleRanks.md). Its sum can be obtained with `F. Rank`. The list of consecutive quotients in the tautological filtration can be obtained later with `bundles F`, see [bundles](../../Schubert2/methodFunction/bundles.md). See also [SubBundles](../../Schubert2/symbol/SubBundles.md) and [QuotientBundles](../../Schubert2/symbol/QuotientBundles.md). The (relative) tautological line bundle can be obtained later with `OO_F(1)`. The structure map from `F` to the variety of `E` can be obtained later with `F. StructureMap`, see [StructureMap](../../Schubert2/symbol/StructureMap.md). Abstract sheaves and cycle classes can be pulled back and pushed forward, see [AbstractVarietyMap ^*](AbstractVarietyMap_spc__pow__mul_.md) and  [AbstractVarietyMap _*](AbstractVarietyMap_spc__us__mul_.md).  Integration will work if it works on the variety of `E`, see [integral](../../Schubert2/methodFunction/integral.md). The (relative) tangent bundle can be obtained from it, see [tangentBundle(AbstractVarietyMap)](tangentBundle_lpar_AbstractVarietyMap_rpar_.md).

## Parameters
- **E** — an "abstract sheaf", whose flag bundle is to be formed. If $E$ is, instead, an "abstract variety" then a trivial sheaf on it is used. If $E$ is, instead, an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md) then a trivial sheaf on "point" of rank $E$ is used. If $E$ is omitted, then a trivial sheaf on "point" is used; its rank is the sum of the entries of $r$.
- **r** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), a list $\{r_0, ..., r_{n-1}\}$ of non-negative integers

## Returns
F, an "abstract flag bundle", the flag bundle over the variety of $E$ parametrizing filtrations $0 = E_0 \subseteq{} E_1 \subseteq{} ... \subseteq{} E_n = E$ of $E$ whose successive subquotients are vector bundles $E_{i+1}/E_i$ of rank $r_i$

## Options
- **[VariableNames](../../Schubert2/symbol/VariableNames.md)**
- **[QuotientBundles](../../Schubert2/symbol/QuotientBundles.md)** (default: `true`)
- **[Isotropic](../../Schubert2/symbol/Isotropic.md)** (default: `false`)

## Methods
- [`flagBundle(List)`](#flagbundlelist)
- [`flagBundle(List,ZZ)`](#flagbundlelistzz)
- [`flagBundle(List,AbstractVariety)`](#flagbundlelistabstractvariety)
- [`flagBundle(List,AbstractSheaf)`](#flagbundlelistabstractsheaf)

## Examples
