### `makeChowRing(Ring,Symbol)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SegreClasses.m2:415:28-437:1`
- **Domain:** [Ring](../../Core/type/Ring.md), [Symbol](../../Core/type/Symbol.md)
- **Returns:** [QuotientRing](../../Core/type/QuotientRing.md) (common typical value)

#### Source
```m2
makeChowRing (Ring,Symbol):=(R,h)->(
    Rdegs:=degrees R;
    ChDegs:=unique Rdegs;
    m:=length ChDegs;
    C:= ZZ(monoid[h_1..h_m, Degrees=>ChDegs]);
    K:={};
    ns:={};
    temp:=0;
    for d in ChDegs do (
        temp=0;
        for a in Rdegs do (
            if d==a then temp=temp+1;
        );
        ns=append(ns,temp);
    );

    for i from 0 to length(ChDegs)-1 do (
        K=append(K,C_(i)^(ns_i));
    );
    K=substitute(ideal K,C);
    A:=C/K;
    return A;
);
```

