- **path** — a [String](../../Core/type/String.md), the full path to the executable of the solver
- **Solver** — a [String](../../Core/type/String.md), the name of the solver to configure: CSDP, MOSEK, or SDPA

## Examples
```macaulay2
changeSolver ("CSDP", "/path/to/csdp")
