hVector delta
```

```
o6 = HashTable{0 => 1 }
               1 => 2
               2 => -2
               3 => 0
o6 : HashTable
```

```macaulay2
grading = {{1,0,0},{1,0,0},{1,0,0},{0,1,0},{0,0,1}};
```

```macaulay2
R = ZZ[x_1,x_2,x_3,y,z, Degrees => grading];
```

```macaulay2
gamma = simplicialComplex{x_1*y*z,x_2*y,x_3*z}
```

```
o9 = simplicialComplex | x_3z x_2y x_1yz |
o9 : SimplicialComplex
```

