# minimalCurveBetti
Computes the Betti diagram of the minimal curve

- **Package:** [SpaceCurves](../../SpaceCurves/package/SpaceCurves.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunction](../../Core/type/MethodFunction.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SpaceCurves.m2:346:0-346:17`
- **Aliases:** `SpaceCurves$minimalCurveBetti`

## Description
A finite length module M determines a unique biliaison class. Curves of minimal degrees in this class are called minimal curves. Given the ideal of a curve J, this function returns the Betti tally of any minimal curve of J. Given a finite length module M, this function returns the Betti tally of any minimal curve in the biliaison class specified by M.

## Methods
- [`minimalCurveBetti(Module)`](#minimalcurvebettimodule)
- [`minimalCurveBetti(Ideal)`](#minimalcurvebettiideal)
- [`minimalCurveBetti(Curve)`](#minimalcurvebetticurve)

