### `cycleDecomposition(List)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SpechtModule.m2:665:27-689:1`
- **Domain:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md)
- **Returns:** [List](../../Core/type/List.md) (common typical value)

#### Source
```m2
cycleDecomposition List := perm ->(
    visited:= new MutableList;
    for i to #perm-1 do (visited#i = 0);

    ind:= 0;
    visited#(ind) = 1;
    cycles:= {};
    while ind<#perm do (
        newInd:= perm#(ind);
        cycle := while newInd != ind list newInd do(
            visited#(newInd) = 1;
            newInd = perm#(newInd);
        );
    	cycle = prepend(ind,cycle);
    	cycles = append(cycles,cycle);

        for i from ind to #perm-1 when visited#i==1 do 
        (
            ind = i;
        );
        ind = ind+1;
        visited#(ind) = 1;
    );
    cycles
)
