# fanoFourfold
Random prime Fano fourfold of coindex at most 3

- **Package:** [SpecialFanoFourfolds](../../SpecialFanoFourfolds/package/SpecialFanoFourfolds.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SpecialFanoFourfolds/examples.m2:79:0-79:12`
- **Result type:** [EmbeddedProjectiveVariety](../../MultiprojectiveVarieties/type/EmbeddedProjectiveVariety.md)
- **Aliases:** `SpecialFanoFourfolds$fanoFourfold`

## Parameters
- **(d** — g) a pair of integers belonging to the set $\{(2,0),(3,1),(4,1),(5,1),(4,3),(6,4),(8,5),(10,6),(12,7),(14,8),(16,9),(18,10)\}$

## Returns
an "embedded projective variety", a random prime Fano fourfold of coindex at most 3 having degree $d$ and genus $g$

## Options
- **[CoefficientRing](../../Core/symbol/CoefficientRing.md)** (default: `ZZ/65521`)

## Methods
- [`fanoFourfold(ZZ,ZZ)`](#fanofourfoldzzzz)

## Examples
```macaulay2
X = fanoFourfold(4,1);
```

```
o1 : ProjectiveVariety, 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^6
```

```macaulay2
describe X
```

```
o2 = ambient:.............. PP^6
     dim:.................. 4
     codim:................ 2
     degree:............... 4
     generators:........... 2^2 
     purity:............... true
     dim sing. l.:......... -1
```

```macaulay2
parametrize X
```

```
o3 = multi-rational map consisting of one single rational map
     source variety: PP^4
     target variety: 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^6 cut out by 2 hypersurfaces of degree 2
     dominance: true
     degree: 1
o3 : MultirationalMap (birational map from PP^4 to X)
```

## Source
```m2
fanoFourfold = method(TypicalValue => EmbeddedProjectiveVariety, Options => {CoefficientRing => ZZ/65521});
```

## Method details
### `fanoFourfold(ZZ,ZZ)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SpecialFanoFourfolds/examples.m2:80:24-136:1`
- **Domain:** [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md)
- **Returns:** [EmbeddedProjectiveVariety](../../MultiprojectiveVarieties/type/EmbeddedProjectiveVariety.md) (common typical value)

#### Source
```m2
fanoFourfold (ZZ,ZZ) := o -> (d,g) -> (
    K := o.CoefficientRing;
    if not (instance(K,Ring) and isField K) then error "CoefficientRing option expects a field";
    local Y; local j; local S; local psi;
    local X;
    dg := {(2,0),(3,1),(4,1),(5,1),(4,3),(6,4),(8,5),(10,6),(12,7),(14,8),(16,9),(18,10)};
    if not member((d,g),dg) then error("expected a pair of integers in the set "|toString(dg));
    if d == 2 and g == 0 then X = random({2},0_(PP_K^5));
    if d == 3 and g == 1 then X = random({3},0_(PP_K^5));
    if d == 4 and g == 1 then X = random({{2},{2}},0_(PP_K^6));
    if d == 5 and g == 1 then (
        Y = GG(K,1,4);
        j = parametrize random({{1},{1}},0_Y);
        X = j^* Y;
    );
    if d == 4 and g == 3 then X = random({4},0_(PP_K^5));
    if d == 6 and g == 4 then X = random({{2},{3}},0_(PP_K^6));
    if d == 8 and g == 5 then X = random({3:{2}},0_(PP_K^7));
    if d == 10 and g == 6 then (
        Y = GG(K,1,4);
        j = parametrize random({1},0_Y);
        X = (j^* Y) * random({2},0_(source j));
    );
    if d == 12 and g == 7 then (
        S = surface({3,4},K);
        psi = rationalMap(S * random({1},0_S),2);
        j = parametrize random({1},0_(target psi));
        X = j^* image(2,psi);
    );
    if d == 14 and g == 8 then (
        Y = GG(K,1,5);
        j = parametrize random({4:{1}},0_Y);
        X = j^* Y;
    );
    if d == 16 and g == 9 then (
        S = surface({2},K,ambient=>6);
        psi = rationalMap(S,3,2);
        j = parametrize random({{1},{1}},0_(target psi));
        X = j^* image psi;
    );
    if d == 18 and g == 10 then (
        -- p. 4 of [Kapustka and Ranestad - Vector Bundles On Fano Varieties Of Genus Ten]
        w := gens ring PP_K^13;
        M := matrix {{0,-w_5,w_4,w_6,w_7,w_8,w_0},
                     {w_5,0,-w_3,w_12,w_13,w_9,w_1},
                     {-w_4,w_3,0,w_10,w_11,-w_6-w_13,w_2},
                     {-w_6,-w_12,-w_10,0,w_2,-w_1,w_3},
                     {-w_7,-w_13,-w_11,-w_2,0,w_0,w_4},
                     {-w_8,-w_9,w_6+w_13,w_1,-w_0,0,w_5},
                     {-w_0,-w_1,-w_2,-w_3,-w_4,-w_5,0}};
        Y = Var trim pfaffians(4,M);
        j = toRationalMap parametrize random({1},0_Y);
        X = j^* Y;
    );
    if not (dim X == 4 and degree X == d and sectionalGenus X == g) then error("something went wrong while computing random fourfold of degree "|toString(d)|" and sectional genus "|toString(g));
    return X;
);
