### `gushelMukaiFourfold(Array,Array,String,Thing)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/SpecialFanoFourfolds/GushelMukai.m2:987:50-993:1`
