> Count of parameters in the moduli space of GM fourfolds

This function implements a parameter count explained in the paper [On some families of Gushel-Mukai fourfolds](https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.07026).

Below, we show that the closure of the locus of GM fourfolds containing a cubic scroll has codimension at most one (hence exactly one) in the moduli space of GM fourfolds.

