### `testIdeal(QQ,Ideal)`
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/NonPrincipalTestIdeals.m2:403:24-466:1`
- **Domain:** [QQ](../../Core/type/QQ.md), [Ideal](../../Core/type/Ideal.md)
