## Description
The hypercohomology table is written in the shifted form with H^i(E(d) in row i and column d+i.

## Parameters
- **hi** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), the rightmost degree of the table
- **lo** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), the leftmost degree of the table
