# stableIntersection
Computes the stable intersection of two tropical varieties

- **Package:** [Tropical](../../Tropical/package/Tropical.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
