# getSmoothingFamily
Get a smoothing family for the semigroup L

- **Package:** [WeierstrassSemigroups](../../WeierstrassSemigroups/package/WeierstrassSemigroups.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
- **Defined at:** `/home/flux/.cache/yay/macaulay2/src/M2/M2/Macaulay2/packages/WeierstrassSemigroups.m2:937:11-937:29`
- **Aliases:** `WeierstrassSemigroups$getSmoothingFamily`

## Description
We first test whether by the bound b or the range of degrees the restricted unfolding leads to a smoothing family over a finite field. If yes and with Verbose>0 then the degrees of the parameters of the parameters of the smoothing family are printed. In a second step we try to lift the example to characteristic 0 and check smoothness again.

The intermediate output is explained in smoothnessWithReductions.

## Parameters
- **bound** — an [ZZ](../../Core/type/ZZ.md), degree bound
- **L** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), list of generators of a semigroups
- **range** — a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), range of degrees

## Returns
smooth, a [Boolean](../../Core/type/Boolean.md), true is a smoothing family was found; fib, an [Ideal](../../Core/type/Ideal.md), ideal of a one-parameter smoothing family or null; comps, a [List](../../Core/type/List.md), list of component numbers of the smoothing components discovered

## Options
- **[BaseField](../../WeierstrassSemigroups/symbol/BaseField.md)** (default: `ZZ/10000019`)
- **[CoeffSize](../../WeierstrassSemigroups/symbol/CoeffSize.md)** (default: `1`)
- **[CoeffBound](../../WeierstrassSemigroups/symbol/CoeffBound.md)** (default: `10000`)
- **[Verbose](../../Core/symbol/Verbose.md)** (default: `0`)

## Methods
- [`getSmoothingFamily(List,ZZ)`](#getsmoothingfamilylistzz)
- [`getSmoothingFamily(List,List)`](#getsmoothingfamilylistlist)

## Examples
