I=ideal(y^2*z-x^2)
            2     2
```

```
o2 = ideal(y z - x )
o2 : Ideal of R
```

```macaulay2
WS= whitneyStratifyPol I
```

```
o3 = MutableHashTable{...3...}
o3 : MutableHashTable
```

```macaulay2
peek WS
```

```
o4 = MutableHashTable{0 => {ideal (z, y, x), ideal (1747430111571076z - 258644393880625, y, x)}}
                      1 => {ideal (y, x)}
                                   2     2
                      2 => {ideal(y z - x )}
```

```macaulay2
mWS=minCoarsenWS WS
```

```
o5 = MutableHashTable{...3...}
o5 : MutableHashTable
```

