# gfanStableIntersection
Computes the stable intersection of two balanced fans

- **Package:** [gfanInterface](../../gfanInterface/package/gfanInterface.md)
- **Class:** [MethodFunctionWithOptions](../../Core/type/MethodFunctionWithOptions.md)
- **Protected:** true
- **Mutable:** false
